sequenceDiagram
    %% Status: illustrative fictional system. Requests are solid; replies are dashed.
    accTitle: Illustrative message submission outcomes
    accDescr: Invalid fields produce field errors. Valid fields reach storage. The page confirms a save only after storage succeeds.
    participant page as Visitor page
    participant server as Enquiry handler
    participant store as Message store
    page->>server: Submit message fields
    server->>server: Validate fields
    alt Invalid fields
        server-->>page: Return field errors
    else Valid fields
        server->>store: Insert message
        alt Save succeeds
            store-->>server: Return message ID
            server-->>page: Confirm message saved
        else Save fails
            store-->>server: Return storage error
            server-->>page: Explain retry option
        end
    end
